msgstr "Ponsel membutuhkan waktu terlalu lama untuk mengambil foto."

#: rust/crates/link/src/stills.rs:57
msgid "Lost the phone while it was taking the photo."
msgstr "Koneksi ke ponsel terputus saat mengambil foto."

#: rust/crates/link/src/stills.rs:58
msgid "The phone gave up on the photo, maybe because its stream stopped."
msgstr "Ponsel membatalkan pengambilan foto, mungkin karena stream terhenti."

#: rust/crates/link/src/stills.rs:59
msgid "Telescope couldn't save the photo."
msgstr "Telescope tidak dapat menyimpan foto."

#: rust/crates/link/src/stills.rs:60
msgid "This phone can't take photos from Telescope. Update the app on the phone."
msgstr "Ponsel ini tidak dapat mengambil foto dari Telescope. Perbarui aplikasi di ponsel."

#: rust/crates/system/src/updates.rs:123
msgid "The update information couldn't be read."
msgstr "Informasi pembaruan tidak dapat dibaca."

#: rust/crates/system/src/updates.rs:191
msgid "Couldn't check GitHub's certificate, so updates weren't checked. Security software or a network that inspects HTTPS can cause this."
msgstr "Sertifikat GitHub tidak dapat diperiksa, sehingga pembaruan tidak diperiksa. Perangkat lunak keamanan atau jaringan yang memeriksa HTTPS dapat menyebabkan hal ini."

#: rust/crates/system/src/updates.rs:192
msgid "Couldn't check for updates. Check the internet connection."
msgstr "Tidak dapat memeriksa pembaruan. Periksa koneksi internet."

#: rust/crates/system/src/updates.rs:271
msgid "The download was cut short. Check the internet connection and try again."
msgstr "Unduhan terputus. Periksa koneksi internet dan coba lagi."

#: rust/crates/system/src/updates.rs:275
msgid "The download didn't match its checksum, so it wasn't installed."
msgstr "Unduhan tidak cocok dengan checksum-nya, sehingga tidak diinstal."

#: rust/crates/system/src/updates.rs:359
msgid "The update contains unexpected paths, so it wasn't installed."
msgstr "Pembaruan berisi jalur yang tidak terduga, sehingga tidak diinstal."

#: rust/crates/system/src/updates.rs:411
msgid "The update contains unexpected files, so it wasn't installed."
msgstr "Pembaruan berisi file yang tidak terduga, sehingga tidak diinstal."

#: rust/crates/system/src/updates.rs:507
msgid "The download doesn't contain Telescope, so it wasn't installed."
msgstr "Unduhan tidak memuat Telescope, sehingga tidak diinstal."

#: rust/crates/shell/src/plugins_tab.rs:729
msgid "Couldn't remove it"
msgstr "Tidak dapat menghapusnya"

#: rust/crates/shell/src/plugins_tab.rs:705
msgid "Couldn't save that"
msgstr "Tidak dapat menyimpan perubahan"

#: rust/crates/shell/src/plugins_tab.rs:684
msgid "Couldn't install it"
msgstr "Tidak dapat menginstalnya"

#: rust/crates/shell/src/plugins_tab.rs:691
msgid "Installed, but it won't load"
msgstr "Terinstal, tetapi gagal dimuat"

#: rust/crates/shell/src/plugins_tab.rs:693
msgid "Replaced"
msgstr "Diganti"

#: rust/crates/shell/src/plugins_tab.rs:774
msgid "Couldn't open it"
msgstr "Tidak dapat membukanya"

